WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.200
News. Bad.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.580
We're bankrupt.

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:10.150
Oh, I borrowed money to invest in Bitcoin.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:16.330
Then the price crashed and I sold at a huge
loss. We're ruined. Oh, sorry. I didn't

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.550
realize you were watching TV.

00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:25.150
The tragic impact destroyed the planet
Klarg, along with its 50 billion inhabitants.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.900
In other news, Morbo. Guess what's back.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:30.760
The planet, Klarg?

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:30.770
Nope.

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.620
The price of Bitcoin.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:33.340
Wha?

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:39.400
The virtual "money" is soaring once again,
leading to a high-tech gold rush.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:44.710
Prospectors are heading west where cheap,
filthy electricity beckons the desperate.

00:00:44.740 --> 00:00:47.560
This gives me a desperate idea!

00:00:47.590 --> 00:00:51.550
Haven't you learned that Bitcoin is just a
pyramid scheme for rubes?

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:55.870
Yes, and my plan is to exploit those rubes.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:04.550
You see, the new mining chips are made from
element 81, thallium, a rare element found out west.

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:09.440
I plan to actually mine it, then sell
it to the Bitcoin "miners".

00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:11.730
It's a sure way to repay my loan brokers.

00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:13.730
Oh!

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.420
Yo. We're also leg brokers.

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:19.800
Goodbye, Robot Mafia!

